# Settings for uploading the docs to Rem (docs/ingest-docs.js), and optionally for the
# Atlas Explorer build (docs/build-explorer.js). Copy this file to docs/.env and fill it in.
# Git ignores docs/.env: never commit it.
#
# RAAS_URL: the address of the "Atlas docs" service in the Rem RaaS dashboard,
#   for example https://rag.remservers.me/i/<service id>
# RAAS_KEY: a key of that service, used only by the ingest script. It can replace or delete
#   the docs in Rem, so keep it private, and replace it in the dashboard if it leaks (then
#   update docs/.env and the server's backend/.env, and restart the API).
# The built Explorer page holds no key: its chat asks the Atlas API (POST /api/ask), which
# keeps its own copy of these settings in backend/.env.
RAAS_URL=
RAAS_KEY=

# Optional: the Atlas API address the Explorer chat asks. Empty means VITE_API_URL from
# frontend/.env.production.
# ATLAS_API_URL=
